AudioXL feed probe (measurement build for issue #3).

Applies to cp2077-audio-xl at 6e6909f (AudioXL 0.2.0). Logs, into the AudioXL red4ext log, how the
engine pulls from AudioFeed::Execute per playing id: the first call, any change in requested frames or
channel config, short or not-ready results, and a summary every 250 calls with the call interval in
microseconds. Not for release; the log calls run on the audio thread.

    git clone https://github.com/DigitalVixen/cp2077-audio-xl  (or copy _source/cp2077-audio-xl out)
    git apply tools/audioxl-feed-probe.patch
    cmake -S plugin -B plugin/build -G "Visual Studio 17 2022" -A x64 -DRED4EXT_SDK_DIR=<sdk> -DREDLIB_DIR=<redlib>
    cmake --build plugin/build --config Release

Build from a short path (D:	mp\...): the SDK's generated headers exceed MAX_PATH under a deep tree.

